ocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xr+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e3cdf4c-5cfe-47dd-8447-f0696d686da6","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"弊社はやっと選任インフラがほしい、という感じになってきたから、つよつよな人について学ぶという環境ではないのがなぁ…","ts":"1619211112.314100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EgS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"990fe5b1-04b3-431c-98a2-fedabf1ba73f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まあGamouさんも優秀だからやりたいことができるかは運だけど、まあ普通にいいところ行けそう","ts":"1619192638.313500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xkEq2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B556558B-495D-4C66-9A56-E279427F89B8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"フロントが不足してるとかではあるけど","ts":"1619192369.312200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"am0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76033757-BD41-4FF1-94B7-2A2EF5956F5F","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"弊社言ったらできそうだけどどうなんだろ","ts":"1619192357.311800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Bva3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d563ad06-42b8-4ba7-8afe-cc9aa8a3d5c6","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そうだ御社も良さそうですね！","ts":"1619192316.311300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=ni6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72a7f94f-0f54-43fe-9ff8-6db9a4e0894a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"採用空いたら是非見てやってください\nたぶん公式サイトメンテされてないけど見てくれ以上にexcitingなことになってる","ts":"1619191895.310200","edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1619191909.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hNU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1763730-0a7e-4b0e-aa4b-9799776976bd","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ヘーシャのこと引き合いに出そうと思ったけど時期的に言っていいか微妙だった","ts":"1619191855.309400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"d